  "description": "ERR-BIND/DAO-DRAFT: TableDefs drafted with invalid or conflicting names ('bad!name', 'a.b', '[x]', leading space, 65 characters, a control character, and the existing 'T'), each with one Long field and appended; the failing call and the draft's Name are captured. Then CreateField 'f!' appended to a valid draft, CREATE TABLE [bad!name] by SQL, and CreateQueryDef 'Q!x'. Errors after each.",
